      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t understand why we do this on servo disconnect? And why the EC isn\u0027t taken care of too since it was using this same logic in device_powered_on().",
      "revId": "d0407f17804f5c707db0578b2293a55cb72f26d3",
